  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3/1"/>Gracious One! grant Your people
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3/2"/>who trust in Your Name;
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3/3"/>appoint and advocate for me
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3/4"/>who will hide my sin—
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3/5"/>hide my debt in his left
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3/6"/>and raise my merit in his right,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3/7"/>and bring up Isaac’s ashes]
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3/8"/>so that He will say, “This is it!”
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:yirtzeh_tzom_ammekha/stanza_3/9"/>This sign will take place tomorrow.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
